# Ignore everything under .claude/ (local session state, worktrees, etc.)
# except the fork-knowledge skill, which is meant to be shared/versioned with the repo.
# Must use "/*" (not "/") on the parent so git still descends into it to evaluate
# the negation below — a trailing-slash directory ignore is a full-subtree prune.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills
